{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"NUM","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"民数记","commonName":"民数记","title":"民数记","order":4,"numberOfChapters":36,"sha256":"15cf4962220790a4da9d22a145b019d10740b926b3bbffa17ac7fa7978ccb19d","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/NUM/1.json","lastChapterNumber":36,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/NUM/36.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1272},"chapter":{"number":23,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["巴兰对巴勒说：「你在这里给我筑七座坛，为我预备七只公牛，七只公羊。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["巴勒照巴兰的话行了。巴勒和巴兰在每座坛上献一只公牛，一只公羊。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["巴兰对巴勒说：「你站在你的燔祭旁边，我且往前去，或者耶和华来迎见我。他指示我什么，我必告诉你。」于是巴兰上一净光的高处。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["神迎见巴兰；巴兰说：「我预备了七座坛，在每座坛上献了一只公牛，一只公羊。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["耶和华将话传给巴兰，又说：「你回到巴勒那里，要如此如此说。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["他就回到巴勒那里，见他同摩押的使臣都站在燔祭旁边。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["巴兰便题起诗歌说：",{"text":"巴勒引我出亚兰，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摩押王引我出东山，说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"来啊，为我咒诅雅各；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"来啊，怒骂以色列。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"神没有咒诅的，我焉能咒诅？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华没有怒骂的，我焉能怒骂？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我从高峰看他，从小山望他；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是独居的民，不列在万民中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁能数点雅各的尘土？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁能计算以色列的四分之一？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我愿如义人之死而死；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我愿如义人之终而终。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["巴勒对巴兰说：「你向我做的是什么事呢？我领你来咒诅我的仇敌，不料，你竟为他们祝福。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["他回答说：「耶和华传给我的话，我能不谨慎传说吗？」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["巴兰第二次预言"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["巴勒说：「求你同我往别处去，在那里可以看见他们；你不能全看见，只能看见他们边界上的人。在那里要为我咒诅他们。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["于是领巴兰到了琐腓田，上了毗斯迦山顶，筑了七座坛；每座坛上献一只公牛，一只公羊。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["巴兰对巴勒说：「你站在这燔祭旁边，等我往那边去迎见耶和华。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["耶和华临到巴兰那里，将话传给他；又说：「你回到巴勒那里，要如此如此说。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["他就回到巴勒那里，见他站在燔祭旁边；摩押的使臣也和他在一处。巴勒问他说：「耶和华说了什么话呢？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["巴兰就题诗歌说：",{"text":"巴勒，你起来听；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"西拨的儿子，你听我言。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"神非人，必不致说谎，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也非人子，必不致后悔。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他说话岂不照着行呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他发言岂不要成就呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我奉命祝福；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"神也曾赐福，此事我不能翻转。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他未见雅各中有罪孽，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也未见以色列中有奸恶。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华—他的 神和他同在；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有欢呼王的声音在他们中间。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"神领他们出埃及；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们似乎有野牛之力。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"断没有法术可以害雅各，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也没有占卜可以害以色列。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"现在必有人论及雅各，就是论及以色列说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"神为他行了何等的大事！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这民起来，仿佛母狮，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"挺身，好像公狮，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"未曾吃野食，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"未曾喝被伤者之血，决不躺卧。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["巴勒对巴兰说：「你一点不要咒诅他们，也不要为他们祝福。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":["巴兰回答巴勒说：「我岂不是告诉你说『凡耶和华所说的，我必须遵行』吗？」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["巴兰第三次预言"]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":["巴勒对巴兰说：「来吧，我领你往别处去，或者 神喜欢你在那里为我咒诅他们。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":["巴勒就领巴兰到那下望旷野的毗珥山顶上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":["巴兰对巴勒说：「你在这里为我筑七座坛，又在这里为我预备七只公牛，七只公羊。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":["巴勒就照巴兰的话行，在每座坛上献一只公牛，一只公羊。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/NUM/23.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/NUM/24.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/NUM/22.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":30}